    {
      "chunk_id": "SOP-SEC-02-sec-1",
      "sop_id": "SOP-SEC-02",
      "title": "Ransomware & Destructive Malware Containment Procedure",
      "section": "1.0 Immediate Triage & Scoping",
      "content": "- Identify initial patient-zero workstation or server from SIEM alerts (high-volume file renames, .locked extensions, shadow copy deletions via vssadmin).\n- Determine propagation vectors: SMB (Port 445 / EternalBlue), RDP (Port 3389), PsExec, or compromised service accounts.\n- Assess whether enterprise hypervisor or centralized backup repositories are threatened.",
