        "encrypted"
      ],
      "embedding": null
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "SOP-SEC-02-sec-3",
      "sop_id": "SOP-SEC-02",
      "title": "Ransomware & Destructive Malware Containment Procedure",
      "section": "3.0 Eradication & Decryption Analysis",
      "content": "- Step 3.1: Capture RAM dump with WinPmem / LiME for cryptographic key extraction before malware process termination.\n- Step 3.2: Identify ransomware binary hash and check against NoMoreRansom and MITRE ATT&CK databases.\n- Step 3.3: Terminate malicious parent and child processes; delete persistence artifacts, scheduled tasks, and rogue services.",
