      "sop_id": "SOP-SEC-03",
      "title": "Unauthorized Access & Privilege Escalation Response Procedure",
      "section": "1.0 Incident Identification",
      "content": "- Detect abnormal privilege transitions: additions to 'Domain Admins', 'Enterprise Admins', sudoers modifications, or unexpected token impersonation (SeDebugPrivilege / SeImpersonatePrivilege).\n- Detect impossible travel or anomalous location authentications on privileged accounts.",
