    {
      "chunk_id": "SOP-SEC-03-sec-2",
      "sop_id": "SOP-SEC-03",
      "title": "Unauthorized Access & Privilege Escalation Response Procedure",
      "section": "2.0 Containment Actions",
      "content": "- Step 2.1: Immediately disable the compromised identity account in Identity Provider (Active Directory / IAM).\n- Step 2.2: Terminate all active Kerberos TGT tickets, OAuth refresh tokens, and interactive terminal/SSH sessions associated with the identity.\n- Step 2.3: Restrict inbound access to target server: enforce strict jump-box / bastion host IP allowlisting.",
