    {
      "chunk_id": "SOP-SEC-03-sec-3",
      "sop_id": "SOP-SEC-03",
      "title": "Unauthorized Access & Privilege Escalation Response Procedure",
      "section": "3.0 Forensics & Eradication",
      "content": "- Step 3.1: Audit all commands executed during the unauthorized session via bash_history, auditd, or Windows Event Log 4688 / Sysmon Event ID 1.\n- Step 3.2: Check for planted backdoors: authorized_keys modifications, SUID binary creations, hidden local administrative accounts, web shells.\n- Step 3.3: Roll the Kerberos krbtgt account password twice if Domain Controller compromise is suspected.",
