      "sop_id": "SOP-SEC-03",
      "title": "Unauthorized Access & Privilege Escalation Response Procedure",
      "section": "4.0 Recovery & Compliance",
      "content": "- Re-issue cryptographically strong credentials with mandatory hardware-bound security keys (FIDO2 WebAuthn).\n- File forensic audit log report within 24 hours in compliance with regulatory notification mandates.",
