      "sop_id": "SOP-SEC-04",
      "title": "Brute-Force & Credential Stuffing Mitigation Procedure",
      "section": "1.0 Triage & Attack Pattern Analysis",
      "content": "- Identify attack vector: SSH (port 22), RDP (port 3389), HTTP/REST auth endpoints, VPN gateways.\n- Review failure thresholds: >10 failed authentication attempts within 60 seconds against single or multiple accounts.\n- Distinguish between distributed credential stuffing (botnet/Tor exit nodes) vs. targeted single-source brute force.",
