    {
      "chunk_id": "SOP-SEC-04-sec-2",
      "sop_id": "SOP-SEC-04",
      "title": "Brute-Force & Credential Stuffing Mitigation Procedure",
      "section": "2.0 Rapid Perimeter Containment",
      "content": "- Step 2.1: Trigger automated or manual IP rate-limiting and temporary IP ban (Fail2ban / WAF IP drop rule) for offending CIDR / IP.\n- Step 2.2: Invalidate compromised or locked user accounts temporarily to stop password spraying exhaustion.\n- Step 2.3: Enforce CAPTCHA / Proof-of-Work challenge on exposed authentication endpoints.",
