      "sop_id": "SOP-SEC-04",
      "title": "Brute-Force & Credential Stuffing Mitigation Procedure",
      "section": "3.0 Eradication & Hardening",
      "content": "- Step 3.1: Disable password authentication on external management ports; mandate certificate/SSH-key based authentication only.\n- Step 3.2: Move exposed administrative management ports behind zero-trust network access (ZTNA) or corporate VPN.\n- Step 3.3: Inspect successful logins immediately preceding or following the spike to ensure zero breached sessions.",
